Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0/9] cpm: update deployment customizations

Apply the numbered patches in series order to the pinned public
upstream commit. This series preserves the shared ICPM/PCPM behavior.
Review each patch and run the deployment and application checks before
publishing. No review, testing or DCO trailers are synthesized.

Codex (9):
  fix: preserve TOMORI customizations on Ingressi v2.10.0
  feat: redesign shared interface with Fluent 2 styling
  fix: align switch thumb with Fluent track dimensions
  feat: simplify proxy host protection and certificate presentation
  test: verify compact protection and readable certificate expiry
  fix: align shared controls and WAF status presentation
  feat: soften interface colors with an accessible pastel palette
  fix: refine pastel contrast against production surfaces
  fix: contain request log labels within the scroll area

